   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Slime name plate kit for game ui. Purple phlegm texture square and circle avatar frame isolated vector set. Violet button with liquid drop design asset for web interface. Goo sign tag with border.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
